      "conversion": "@Redirect of six of the seven EntityFeature.test calls in MagicEventHandler.onLivingAttack(LivingIncomingDamageEvent) (ordinals 0, 2-6; target-argument capture of the event; the handler makes the shipped call itself when it does not leave the test out) + an @Accessor of EntityFeature.list + an @Inject at the RETURN of EntityFeature.add (the features' purity is checked again after every add); helper bons.furious.patch.l2complements_coo49.AttackChecks. 1.21.1: LivingIncomingDamageEvent; MAGIC_REJECT pairs with Tags.DamageTypes.IS_MAGIC.",
